  "title": "dumpcap: clean up the file-finishing code.",
  "description": "Pull the \"write out the final Interface Statistics Block\" logic out of\nthe close routine and put it into a finish routine.  Then have the\n\"we're done with this capture file\" code call the finish routine before\ncalling the close routine, and check for the finish routine failing.\nThat lets the \"we're done with this capture file\" code handle the \"last\nISB\" failing better.\n\nAI-Assisted: no",
